      "proof_chapter": "discriminants-of-number-fields",
      "proof_leanok": true,
      "text": "Let $K=\\QQ(\\a)$ be a number field with $n=[K:\\QQ]$ and let $B=\\{1,\\a,\\a^2,\\dots,\\a^{n-1}\\}$. Then \\[\\Delta(B)=(-1)^{\\frac{n(n-1)}{2}}N_{K/\\QQ}(m_\\a'(\\a))\\] where $m_\\a'$ is the derivative of $m_\\a(x)$ (which we recall denotes the minimal polynomial of $\\a$)."
    },
