      "text": "Let $K = \\QQ(\\alpha)$ be a number field, where $\\alpha$ is an algebraic integer. Let $B = \\{1, \\alpha, \\ldots, \\alpha^{[K : \\QQ] - 1} \\}$ be the basis given by $\\alpha$ and let $x \\in \\mathcal{O}_K$. Then $\\Delta(B)x \\in \\ZZ[\\alpha]$."
