      "text": "Let $\\zeta_p$ be a $p$-th root of unity for $p$ an odd prime, let $\\lam_p=1-\\zeta_p$ and $K=\\QQ(\\zeta_p)$. Then \\[\\Delta(\\{1,\\zeta_p,\\dots,\\zeta_p^{p-2}\\})=\\Delta(\\{1,\\lam_p,\\dots,\\lam_p^{p-2}\\})=(-1)^{\\frac{(p-1)}{2}}p^{p-2}.\\]"
