      "text": "Let $p$ be a regular odd prime, $\\epsilon \\in \\ZZ[\\zeta_p]^\\times$ and $n \\in \\ZZ_{\\geq 1}$. Then the equation $x^p+y^p+\\epsilon(1-\\zeta_p)^{pn}z^p=0$ has no solutions with $x,y,z \\in \\ZZ[\\zeta_p]$, all non-zero and $xyz$ coprime to $(1-\\zeta_p)$."
