      "proof_leanok": true,
      "text": "Let $K/F$ be a Galois extension of number fields whose Galois group $\\Gal(K/F)$ is cyclic with generator $\\sigma$. If $\\a \\in K$ is such that $N_{K/F}(\\a)=1$, then \\[ \\a =\\beta/ \\sigma(\\beta)\\] for some $\\beta \\in \\OO_K$."
    },
    {
