      ],
      "proof_uses": [],
      "has_proof": true,
      "statement_event": 75,
      "proof_event": 76,
      "proof_chapter": "kummers-lemma",
      "proof_leanok": true,
      "text": "Let $K/F$ be an extension of number fields and let $S$ denote the set of $\\a \\in \\OO_K$ be such that $K=F(\\a)$. Then \\[ \\gothd_{K/F} = \\left (m_{\\a}'(\\a) : \\a \\in S \\right )\\] where $m_\\a$ is denotes the minimal polynomial of $\\a$."
    },
    {
      "id": "lem:diff_ram",
      "kind": "lemma",
      "position": 41,
