      "has_proof": true,
      "statement_event": 77,
      "proof_event": 78,
      "proof_chapter": "kummers-lemma",
      "proof_leanok": true,
      "text": "Let $K/F$ be an extension of number fields with $\\gothp_F, \\gothp_K$ prime ideas in $K,F$ respectively, with $\\gothp_K^e \\parallel \\gothp_F$ for $e >0$. Then $\\gothp_K^{e-1} \\mid \\gothd_{K/F}$ and $\\gothp_K^{e} \\mid \\gothd_{K/F}$ iff $\\gothp_F \\mid e$."
    },
    {
