      "text": "Let $u \\in F$ with $F=\\QQ(\\zeta_p)$ be a unit such that \\[u \\equiv a^p \\mod \\lam_p^p\\] for some $a \\in \\OO_F$. The either $u = \\epsilon^p$ for some $\\epsilon \\in \\OO_F^\\times$ or $p$ divides the class number of $F$."
